  "prefLabel": "Hedc 102.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 102.01 Purpose. The commission shall make rules and exercise regulatory powers in accordance with RSA 21-N:8-a, II(e) governing institutions of higher education and private postsecondary career schools, except those noted as excluded pursuant to RSA 187-A and RSA 188-F.\n\nSource. #14402, eff 10-15-25",
